    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/2c76fcf8f5f5abf1837da62c47aefde5.avif?t=1658910578\" /></div><br>At Your Service is a wacky co-op party game for up to four players. Visit futuristic and fantasy themed homes, and get them clean and tidy before their owner\u2019s get angry! Just don\u2019t let the bumbling wizards casting spells, or grumpy dads making coffee distract you from making a clean getaway!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique worlds and characters!</h2></strong><br>Drive your own company van and explore three distinct zones. Visit the suburban homes of the 80\u2019s, sci-fi homes of the future, and even a wizard\u2019s magic castle! <br><br>Expand your cleaning crew along the way by unlocking a team of diverse playable characters. But watch out for the unique cast of funny home owners determined to get in your way, including dads throwing tantrums, kids setting off explosives and even wizard\u2019s summoning lightning storms!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete the crazy tasks any way you can!</h2></strong><br>Washing dirty clothes, trimming overgrown bushes, and disposing of magic potions is just the start. Whether it\u2019s using experimental teleporters or bewitched moving platforms, use any means necessary to complete the task at hand. Just make sure the owners don\u2019t catch you lying down on the job!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/2c76fcf8f5f5abf1837da62c47aefde5.avif?t=1658910578\" /></div><br>At Your Service is a wacky co-op party game for up to four players. Visit futuristic and fantasy themed homes, and get them clean and tidy before their owner\u2019s get angry! Just don\u2019t let the bumbling wizards casting spells, or grumpy dads making coffee distract you from making a clean getaway!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/f215bbb3892eef578eb1ae962025e271.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique worlds and characters!</h2></strong><br>Drive your own company van and explore three distinct zones. Visit the suburban homes of the 80\u2019s, sci-fi homes of the future, and even a wizard\u2019s magic castle! <br><br>Expand your cleaning crew along the way by unlocking a team of diverse playable characters. But watch out for the unique cast of funny home owners determined to get in your way, including dads throwing tantrums, kids setting off explosives and even wizard\u2019s summoning lightning storms!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/0a93f77fc777670faf310a102961634a.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete the crazy tasks any way you can!</h2></strong><br>Washing dirty clothes, trimming overgrown bushes, and disposing of magic potions is just the start. Whether it\u2019s using experimental teleporters or bewitched moving platforms, use any means necessary to complete the task at hand. Just make sure the owners don\u2019t catch you lying down on the job!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.poster.avif?t=1658910578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.webm?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731130/extras/79f62aa2800994dbfc0b72d68f820dd5.mp4?t=1658910578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
